# Processes and Workflows Templates

This directory contains templates for processes and workflows in the Technology/Engineering domain.

## Directory Structure

- `01_GENERAL_WORKFLOW.md` - General workflow template
- `02_DELIVERABLES_TRIGGERS_SYSTEM.md` - Deliverables and triggers system template
- `03_FUTURE_PROOF_WORKSPACE_ACTION_PLAN.md` - Future-proof workspace action plan template